<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Garbage Collection Resul=
t:</strong>
Object t=E1=BA=A1i 0x1000 becomes eligible for collection v=C3=AC no refere=
nces exist.</p>
<h4 class=3D"text-base font-bold text-text-100 mt-1">=F0=9F=94=AC Step-by-s=
tep Garbage Collection Process</h4>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Phase 1: Mark Phase</str=
ong></p>
<ol class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-decimal space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">GC starts t=E1=BB=AB root objec=
ts</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Follows all references recursiv=
ely</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Marks every reachable object</l=
i>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Creates "marked set" of live ob=
jects</li>
</ol>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Phase 2: Sweep Phase</st=
rong></p>
<ol class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-decimal space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Scans entire heap memory</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Any object not trong "marked se=
t" =3D garbage</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Frees memory occupied by garbag=
e objects</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Updates memory allocation point=
ers</li>
</ol>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Phase 3: Compact Phase (=
Optional)</strong></p>
<ol class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-decimal space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Moves live objects together</li=
>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Reduces memory fragmentation</l=
i>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Updates all references to moved=
 objects</li>
</ol>
