<h4 class=3D"text-base font-bold text-text-100 mt-1">=F0=9F=92=AD Principal=
's Design Philosophy</h4>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Sau 7 n=C4=83m experience t=E1=
=BA=A1i MAANG companies, t=C3=B4i learned r=E1=BA=B1ng successful OOP trong=
 JavaScript requires balancing flexibility v=E1=BB=9Bi predictability. Key =
principles:</p>
<ol class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-decimal space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Explicit State Manageme=
nt</strong>: Make object state changes obvious</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Consistent Method Inter=
faces</strong>: Same method name should behave predictably across objects</=
li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Bounded Complexity</str=
ong>: Objects should have single responsibility</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Defensive Programming</=
strong>: Methods should validate inputs v=C3=A0 handle edge cases</li>
</ol>
